      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting CoCrFeNiTi alloy has a simple crystal structure.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting CoCrFeNiTi alloy has favorable plasticity and machinability.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A specific amount of Mn2O3 or similar nanoparticles can be introduced into CoCrFeNiTi as nanoscale precipitates.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Selective laser melting can produce the proposed Mn2O3 nanoprecipitate distribution in CoCrFeNiTi.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mechanical alloying can produce the proposed Mn2O3 nanoprecipitate distribution in CoCrFeNiTi.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant structural mediator is the size and spatial distribution of nanoscale precipitates within the alloy matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::rubric_card::000::6980db1684",
        "PMC8282813::rubric_card::000::82c51610a5"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The nanoscale precipitates will cause Orowan strengthening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The nanoscale precipitates will cause grain-boundary strengthening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::rubric_card::000::6980db1684"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will increase the hardness of CoCrFeNiTi relative to the unmodified alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will increase the yield strength of CoCrFeNiTi relative to the unmodified alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7229066::rubric_card::000::3519eb0b1c",
        "PMC8282813::rubric_card::000::82c51610a5"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will increase the compressive strength of CoCrFeNiTi relative to the unmodified alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7229066::rubric_card::000::3519eb0b1c",
        "PMC8282813::rubric_card::000::82c51610a5"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The strengthened alloy will retain favorable plasticity.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
